//
// Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab all show the first icon in the executable,
// and SDL2 goes looking for that same one when it registers the window class --
// so this single resource is every icon the Windows build needs.
//
// The path is substituted by CMake because the .ico is a build product:
// tools/make_icons.py renders it from gui/appicon.png, the one image the macOS
// .icns comes from as well. Forward slashes are what CMake hands over and what
// the resource compiler expects.

1 ICON "@ATHENA_SIM_ICON@"
